    "detailed_description": "Embark on a thrilling interstellar journey with your fuzzy co-pilot in this exhilarating space adventure game. As your furry friend is a rookie in space exploration, your guidance and expertise will be crucial to navigate the perils of the cosmos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345570/extras/b5c2f251d129f9a3a8d12cf35b2bac7a.poster.avif?t=1696896130\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345570/extras/b5c2f251d129f9a3a8d12cf35b2bac7a.webm?t=1696896130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345570/extras/b5c2f251d129f9a3a8d12cf35b2bac7a.mp4?t=1696896130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345570/extras/d4ec520e7d1b50df3488df6bf3cbe676.poster.avif?t=1696896130\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345570/extras/d4ec520e7d1b50df3488df6bf3cbe676.webm?t=1696896130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345570/extras/d4ec520e7d1b50df3488df6bf3cbe676.mp4?t=1696896130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Master your spaceship:</strong> Pilot your craft with precision, utilizing your knowledge of physics and expert piloting skills to traverse the vastness of space.<br></li><li><strong>Protect your companion:</strong> Keep a watchful eye on your furry sidekick as you maneuver through obstacles, shielding them from harm by blocking incoming debris with your ship or guiding them to safety.<br></li><li><strong>Laser gun at your disposal:</strong> Utilize your spaceship's laser gun to blast away incoming space debris, clearing a path for both you and your fuzzy friend.<br></li><li><strong>Docking capabilities:</strong> Invite your companion to dock their ship with yours, allowing them to experience the awe-inspiring wonders of the universe up close and personal.<br></li><li> <strong>Unforgettable cosmic journey:</strong> Explore the breathtaking beauty of outer space with your furry companion by your side, creating lasting memories as you uncover the mysteries of the cosmos together.</li></ul><br>Prepare to embark on an unforgettable adventure, piloting your ship and safeguarding your endearing partner as you uncover the marvels of the universe!",
    "about_the_game": "Embark on a thrilling interstellar journey with your fuzzy co-pilot in this exhilarating space adventure game. As your furry friend is a rookie in space exploration, your guidance and expertise will be crucial to navigate the perils of the cosmos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345570/extras/b5c2f251d129f9a3a8d12cf35b2bac7a.poster.avif?t=1696896130\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345570/extras/b5c2f251d129f9a3a8d12cf35b2bac7a.webm?t=1696896130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345570/extras/b5c2f251d129f9a3a8d12cf35b2bac7a.mp4?t=1696896130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345570/extras/d4ec520e7d1b50df3488df6bf3cbe676.poster.avif?t=1696896130\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345570/extras/d4ec520e7d1b50df3488df6bf3cbe676.webm?t=1696896130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345570/extras/d4ec520e7d1b50df3488df6bf3cbe676.mp4?t=1696896130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Master your spaceship:</strong> Pilot your craft with precision, utilizing your knowledge of physics and expert piloting skills to traverse the vastness of space.<br></li><li><strong>Protect your companion:</strong> Keep a watchful eye on your furry sidekick as you maneuver through obstacles, shielding them from harm by blocking incoming debris with your ship or guiding them to safety.<br></li><li><strong>Laser gun at your disposal:</strong> Utilize your spaceship's laser gun to blast away incoming space debris, clearing a path for both you and your fuzzy friend.<br></li><li><strong>Docking capabilities:</strong> Invite your companion to dock their ship with yours, allowing them to experience the awe-inspiring wonders of the universe up close and personal.<br></li><li> <strong>Unforgettable cosmic journey:</strong> Explore the breathtaking beauty of outer space with your furry companion by your side, creating lasting memories as you uncover the mysteries of the cosmos together.</li></ul><br>Prepare to embark on an unforgettable adventure, piloting your ship and safeguarding your endearing partner as you uncover the marvels of the universe!",
    "short_description": "Explore the cosmos with your furry friend and collect antimatter to open portals to different celestial worlds. Use gravity and momentum to navigate through planets, asteroids, and comets while avoiding black holes and space debris.",
